          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಸ್ನೇಹ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ನೇಹ — snēha — \"friendship\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಮ್ಮ ಸ್ನೇಹ ಶಾಲೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಶುರುವಾಯಿತು. namma snēha śāleyalli śuruvāyitu. Our friendship began at school."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ನೇಹಿತ, a friend, is built on it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ನೇಹ (snēha) is borrowed from Sanskrit sneha, \"oiliness, smoothness\", and from there \"tenderness, friendship\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
