              "text": "ಬಾಂಧವ್ಯ — bāndhavya — \"a bond; close ties\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಎರಡು ಕುಟುಂಬಗಳ ನಡುವೆ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯ ಬಾಂಧವ್ಯ ಇದೆ. eraḍu kuṭumbagaḷa naḍuve oḷḷeya bāndhavya ide. There is a good bond between the two families."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Related to ಬಂಧು, kin."
            }
          ]
        },
