          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಾಂಧವ್ಯ (bāndhavya) is a learned abstract noun built on Sanskrit bāndhava, \"kinsman\" (CDIAL 9208): the state of being bound as kin."
            }
