          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಾಜಿ ಮಾಡಿಕೊ (rāji māḍiko) joins rāji, usually traced to Hindustani rāzī, \"content, agreeing\", and ಮಾಡಿಕೊ, \"to do for oneself\"."
            }
